---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout path="/about">
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-20">
    <div class="mb-12">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight mb-4">
        About Our Architecture
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-400">
        How we achieve industry-leading Core Web Vitals while retaining real-time dynamic SEO control.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none space-y-8 text-slate-300">
      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">1. The Problem with Bloated CMSs</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-sm text-slate-400">
          Traditional platforms like WordPress or heavy React SPAs ship megabytes of unused JavaScript, heavy plugins, and bulky database queries. This kills Google PageSpeed metrics and hurts organic ranking positions.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">2. The Astro Islands Advantage</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-sm text-slate-400">
          Astro strips away 100% of the client-side JavaScript for marketing pages by default. The browser receives clean HTML, pre-rendered CSS, and optimized media. Dynamic interactive widgets (like our live SEO SERP preview) are loaded only where specifically needed.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">3. Unified SQLite Storage</h2>
        <p class="leading-relaxed text-sm text-slate-400">
          By utilizing LibSQL, you have the choice between an embedded zero-maintenance local file (`file:local.db`) for cPanel/VPS, or Turso's cloud edge SQLite for free zero-cost serverless hosting on Vercel.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
